POST {{baseUrl}}/work-centers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workCenterCode": "WC-001",
  "workCenterDescription": "Centro de trabajo principal",
  "workAreaId": "{{workAreaId}}",
  "centerCostCode": 1001,
  "centerCostDescription": "Costo centro 1001"
}

### Nota: copia el id devuelto en create y pegalo en @workCenterId

### Get one work center
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-centers/{{workCenterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get work centers (all active by default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-centers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get work centers filtered by code
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-centers?workCenterCode=WC-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get work centers filtered by workAreaId
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-centers?workAreaId={{workAreaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update work center (partial)
